                                "example_id": "a576796b-6009-413e-8231-4f5e983293ce",
                                "sense_id": "937b2c00-4eac-3e7f-bb81-9f0b620b32eb",
                                "text": "He become the maintainer of the software project."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "704df336-0f93-436c-8a5c-933875804500",
                                "sense_id": "937b2c00-4eac-3e7f-bb81-9f0b620b32eb",
                                "text": "Blessed are the maynteyners of peace: for they shalbe called the chyldren of God."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4e85b3c-b541-37cb-a102-eae7221384ec",
                        "entry_id": "f333f71d-74fd-3664-bd99-3ef337b451b4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who does maintenance work."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8146ffe7-2a3e-46c2-b0b5-6592dffa51fe",
                                "sense_id": "a4e85b3c-b541-37cb-a102-eae7221384ec",
                                "text": "“In somm trouble. Got off trail to go to br. Now lost. Can u call AMC to c if a trail maintainer can help me. Somewhere north of woods road. Xox,” she wrote."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cf339dc-3163-4a21-89b0-ccac5adb7ee9",
                                "sense_id": "a4e85b3c-b541-37cb-a102-eae7221384ec",
                                "text": "“To stay open, the senior enlisted leader of U.S. Forces-Afghanistan Forward said he needed people to cover security,” Duncan wrote. “Personnel Recovery Task Force (PRTF) Pilots, maintainers and support personnel donned their vests, helmets and M-4 rifles and manned defensive fighting positions.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea760c06-f2fd-4cf8-9afa-cf4af5497c7b",
                                "sense_id": "a4e85b3c-b541-37cb-a102-eae7221384ec",
                                "text": "RAIB looked at why the washers were missing. This took it into the relationship between the wagon's owner and maintainers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "311533a5-7f58-4df5-b1e5-391edd9c02ae",
                                "sense_id": "a4e85b3c-b541-37cb-a102-eae7221384ec",
                                "text": "Muehlendorf told CNN that O’Hara was a crew chief by trade, explaining that his “military occupational specialty was a 15T and he was originally trained to be a maintainer of Black Hawk helicopters.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
